# =============================================================================
# Rare Disease Atlas -- .gitignore
# Everything below is either large, regenerable by scripts/, private, or local.
# Tracked: source code, config/, eval/ question sets, docs/ (incl. screenshots), demo/ (video + transcript), README.md,
# tests/ (incl. queries.txt, project.txt, video.txt), requirements.txt, .env.example, start/stop.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data -- downloaded or derived; rebuild with `bash scripts/run_all.sh`
#   data/raw     PubMed abstracts (publisher copyright, do not redistribute),
#                MONDO/HPO/Orphanet/Reactome dumps, ClinVar (450 MB), CT.gov, RePORTER, PubTator
#   data/graph   parquet tables built by scripts/20-40
#   data/cache   cached plain-language explanations (cite edge ids; stale after a rebuild)
#   artifacts/   literature search index (embeds a copy of every abstract)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
artifacts/
*.parquet
*.jsonl
*.npy
*.faiss
*.index
*.pkl
*.part
*.tmp

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Models -- multi-GB, fetched by scripts/00_fetch_models.sh
# (models may be a symlink, hence both patterns)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
models
models/
*.gguf
*.bin
*.safetensors
*.onnx

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated output
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
*.log
eval/*.json
eval/*.md
eval/archive/
screenshots/
shots*/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets and local configuration (.env.example is the tracked template)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.streamlit/secrets.toml
*.pem
*.key

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Hackathon brief and slide decks (large binaries, distributed separately)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.ppt
*.key.zip
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
# Videos are ignored by default, except the 1-minute demo that the README refers to.
*.mp4
!demo/video.mp4

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editors, OS, tooling
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.claude/
